From 3ddf5144c6985bf0a155f560c254b3b2798abd08 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ewout van Mansom <ewout@vanmansom.name>
Date: Sat, 11 Apr 2026 22:08:35 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] feat: restructure Go AST tools into individual FC-format
 operations

Split monolithic go_edit tool into 57 individual tools (go_create_function,
go_add_struct_field, go_insert_call, etc.) matching Gemma 4's FC training
format. Go helper prompt.go registry is single source of truth for tool
names, descriptions, and system prompt. TypeScript factory generates
Tool.define() per registry entry at startup. Includes go_fix for automatic
syntax error repair and e2e tests verified against llama.cpp.
